  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on support to the development of mechanisms and respective empowerment, by which communities within the Okavango River Basin can participate in the planning of basin management activities. Kalahari Conservation Society (KCS) an NGO based in Gaborone is the implementing agency and has sub-contracts with NNF (Namibia) and ACADIR (Angola).</narrative>
  </description>
